        "https://catalog.utdallas.edu/2025/undergraduate/programs/aht/philosophy (2026-07-27 13:37:25) 3/",
        "12 semester credit hours of upper-division Philosophy electives.",
        "Students must select 6 semester credit hours of courses from the following list of courses with",
        "https://catalog.utdallas.edu/2025/undergraduate/programs/aht/philosophy (2026-07-27 13:37:25) 4/",
        "https://catalog.utdallas.edu/2025/undergraduate/programs/aht/philosophy (2026-07-27 13:37:25) 5/",
